                                "sense_id": "128d35cd-4b3a-3cae-a132-3b644a9ae664",
                                "text": "Brian Cox as Logan Roy (2019), 31:28 from the start, in Succession, season 2, episode 8: “I saw a mistle thrush at the bandstand.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "36c3aa3f-1fba-39da-8787-b22b31bf2d6d",
                        "entry_id": "141b6b63-689c-3fe6-b1da-6d8513ee6668",
                        "glosses": [
